# KK Phone Rental v16.7.0 — Phase 3.9.5 Public Bilingual TH/EN Lite

## Scope
Frontend-only bilingual upgrade based on Phase 3.9.4. No Google Sheet, Apps Script, Admin/CRM, price, stock, or booking-allocation logic was changed.

## Changed files
- `index.html`
- `script.js`
- `style.css`

## Added
- TH / ENG language switch on the public website.
- Language preference stored in `localStorage` (`kk_public_language`).
- Optional `?lang=en` URL support.
- Thai/English translations for filters, buttons, availability, modal, FAQ, empty/error states, metadata, booking CTA, and waitlist CTA.
- English LINE booking and waitlist messages when English is selected.
- LINE booking field changed from **เวลาที่สะดวกรับเครื่อง** to **เวลาที่สะดวกรับอุปกรณ์**. English uses **Preferred equipment pick-up time**.
- FAQ wording updated to cover phone-only, lens-only, and bundle rentals.

## Google Sheet impact
None. Event names, venues, package names, web notes, and use-case text continue to display exactly as stored in Google Sheet. Adding English columns is not required for this Lite phase.

## Deployment
Replace the three public frontend files and redeploy Vercel. Apps Script does not need to be redeployed. Hard refresh once after deployment.
